abstract: >-
  Nine preparation-only agent skills for Australian public-practice
  accounting workflows, with source verification, reconciliation checks and
  human review boundaries. This record is pinned to the tagged v0.1.5
  release. The default branch carries a nineteen-skill public-practice and
  contracting integration candidate, which is not a published release.
